title: Party Disunity
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: party_disunity_timer = 0 and (dissent >= 0.3 or (thalmannites_dissent > 30 and not reformists_resign) or (conciliators_dissent > 30 and not centrists_resign) or (labor_wing_dissent > 30 and not sapd_formed) or (ultras_dissent > 30 and not unions_independent))
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4
card-image: img/Reichstagsfraktion_der_SPD.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs

# TODO: party dissent events for every faction, have a good image for this... 

= Party Disunity

The party is being torn apart by internal dissent. Upset at the leadership and general direction, factions have started sabotaging their rivals, hampering our efforts to win votes and carry out our policies.

[? if thalmannites_dissent > 30 : The reformists are upset at our direction.  ?]
[? if conciliators_dissent > 30 : The centrists are displeased with the direction of our party. ?]
[? if labor_wing_dissent > 30 : The trade unions disagree with our present course of action. ?]
[? if ultras_dissent > 30 and ultras = 1 : Leftists are making noises about another party split. ?]

Something must be done to reinforce party unity.

- @enforce_unity
- @concessions_thalmannites
- @concessions_conciliators
- @concessions_labor_wing
- @concessions_ultras
- @do_nothing


@enforce_unity
title: Enforce party discipline.
on-arrival: thalmannites_dissent -= 5; conciliators_dissent -= 5; labor_wing_dissent -= 5; ultras_dissent -= 5; workers_kpd -= 4; new_middle_kpd -= 2; unemployed_kpd -= 2

Enforcing party discipline reduces dissent, but it could lead to an exit of dissenting members.

# enforcing party discipline applies to all parties.

# each party has a concessions action and an expulsions action.

@concessions_thalmannites
title: Give concessions to Thalmann.
view-if: thalmannites_dissent > 30
on-arrival: thalmannites_dissent -= 7; labor_wing_dissent += 5

We have promoted key Thalmann allies within the party. This may alienate the labor wing, however.

@concessions_conciliators
title: Give concessions to the Conciliators.
view-if: conciliators_dissent > 30
on-arrival: conciliators_dissent -= 7; thalmannites_dissent += 5; 

We have promised to give the Conciliators key positions in the party. The Thalmannites are outraged.

@concessions_labor_wing
title: Give concessions to the Labor wing.
view-if: labor_wing_dissent > 30
on-arrival: labor_wing_dissent -= 7; thalmannites_dissent += 5

We have promised to reinstate previously expelled members of the right opposition, and offer the unions more representation in the party. This infuriates the Thalmannites.

@concessions_ultras
title: Give concessions to the Ultras.
view-if: ultras_dissent > 30
on-arrival: ultras_dissent -= 7; 

The Ultras will recieve more decision making power in the RFB. 

@do_nothing
title: Let the factions argue with themselves.
on-arrival: labor_wing_dissent += 1; thalmannites_dissent += 1; conciliators_dissent += 1; ultras_dissent += 1

Let the factions bicker; perhaps dissent is healthy for the party.

# TODO: should we be allowed to preemptively expel factions?

@expel_thalmannites
title: Expel the dissident reformists.
view-if: thalmannites_dissent > 30

@expel_conciliators
title: Expel the dissident leftists.
view-if: conciliators_dissent > 30

@expel_labor_wing
title: Expel the centrists.
view-if: labor_wing_dissent > 30

@expel_ultras
title: Expel the labor supporters.
view-if: ultras_dissent > 30
